⁖line჻### ❈ Koth⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| Glyph | Court and ordered lineage | Human origin of borrowed vessel | Canonical House office | Crossing pressure | Office range in human speech |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻|---:|---|---|---|---|---|⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🝏` | **KothKel** · ❈ Koth → ⏣ Fetu | Alchemical symbol for the Scepter of Jove: Jupiter’s authority, traditionally linked with the planetary metal tin. | **Pulse** | Jove’s scepter is authority held aloft; Pulse is authority felt as recurring life. The crossing is emblematic rule becoming bodily beat. | **Thing/image:** pulse, beat; **action:** pulse, throb; **quality/state:** pulsing, alive. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜁` | **KothSens** · ❈ Koth → ⬡ Kal | Alchemical symbol for Air: breath, atmosphere, volatility, and the upward element. | **Nostalgia** | Air moves freely and outward; Nostalgia bends movement backward toward memory. The pressure is breath becoming remembered ache. | **Thing/image:** nostalgia, remembered ache; **action:** yearn backward, remember; **quality/state:** nostalgic, longing. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜃` | **KothLinn** · ❈ Koth → ✡ Babdh | Alchemical symbol for Earth: ground, body, weight, and the stable element. | **Ecstasy** | Earth grounds and bears weight; Ecstasy exceeds ordinary bounds. The crossing is ground becoming rapture without losing the body. | **Thing/image:** ecstasy, rapture; **action:** exult, overwhelm; **quality/state:** ecstatic, rapturous. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜄` | **KothBrim** · ❈ Koth → ⚝ Ahn | Alchemical symbol for Water: fluidity, dissolution, reflection, and the downward element. | **Dream** | Water reflects and dissolves; Dream makes an imaginal world. The pressure is fluid image becoming inward vision. | **Thing/image:** dream, vision; **action:** dream, imagine; **quality/state:** dreamlike, oneiric. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜅` | **KothInn** · ❈ Koth → ❂ Vel | Alchemical symbol for Aquafortis: “strong water,” historically nitric acid and a corrosive solvent. | **Vibration** | Aquafortis corrodes and separates; Vibration joins motion to recurrence. The gap is chemical attack becoming oscillation. | **Thing/image:** vibration, tremor; **action:** vibrate, resonate; **quality/state:** vibrating, resonant. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜆` | **KothSubh** · ❈ Koth → ꙮ Sor | Alchemical symbol for Aqua Regia: “royal water,” the solvent associated with dissolving noble metals. | **Sympathy** | Aqua regia dissolves what ordinary solvents cannot; Sympathy lets one body answer another. The pressure is dissolution becoming resonance. | **Thing/image:** sympathy, shared feeling; **action:** sympathize, resonate with; **quality/state:** sympathetic, attuned. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜇` | **KothWell** · ❈ Koth → ❈ Koth | Second alchemical form of Aqua Regia: another written vessel for royal water and noble-metal dissolution. | **Self-Sensation** | Royal water acts outward upon resistant matter; Self-Sensation turns the field inward. The crossing is solvent becoming felt self. | **Thing/image:** self-sensation, felt self; **action:** feel oneself; **quality/state:** self-sensing, embodied. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜈` | **KothMet** · ❈ Koth → ⧗ Dreh | Alchemical symbol for Aqua Vitae: “water of life,” distilled spirit or spirit of wine. | **Ache** | Aqua vitae names distilled life-water and intoxication; Ache is the body’s lingering hurt. The tension is quickening spirit becoming pain that remains. | **Thing/image:** ache, pain; **action:** ache, yearn; **quality/state:** aching, sore. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜉` | **KothKesh** · ❈ Koth → ⊛ Rhea | Second alchemical form of Aqua Vitae: another written vessel for distilled spirit. | **Depth** | The second life-water sign bears volatile spirit; Depth descends and thickens. The pressure is volatility becoming interior distance. | **Thing/image:** depth, deepness; **action:** deepen; **quality/state:** deep, profound. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜊` | **KothSoth** · ❈ Koth → ❄ Zhek | Alchemical symbol for Vinegar: sour acid, solvent, fermentation, and sharpness. | **Harmony** | Vinegar is sour separation; Harmony is consonant joining. The crossing is acid becoming accord. | **Thing/image:** harmony, concord; **action:** harmonize; **quality/state:** harmonious, consonant. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜋` | **KothRhun** · ❈ Koth → ⚛ Shav | Second alchemical form of Vinegar, also used for distilled vinegar. | **Dissonance** | Distilled vinegar sharpens acidity; Dissonance sharpens difference in sound. The House turns chemical bite into audible friction. | **Thing/image:** dissonance, frictional sound; **action:** clash, sound apart; **quality/state:** dissonant, unresolved. |⁖⋰line჻
⁖line჻| `🜌` | **KothDelh** · ❈ Koth → ⌬ Trig | Third alchemical form of Vinegar: a further historical sign for the sour solvent. | **Awe** | The third vinegar sign belongs to a common corrosive liquid; Awe arrests the ordinary before what exceeds it. The pressure is the familiar becoming numinous. | **Thing/image:** awe, wonder; **action:** behold in awe; **quality/state:** awe-struck, numinous. |⁖⋰line჻
